# Build directories.
#
# Matched by prefix, not by name. Listing them individually is what let
# build-httplib/ and build-verify/ get committed in the 0.1.6 release — 202
# files, including a CMakeCache.txt carrying absolute local paths, in a public
# repo. A new build dir must not be one forgotten .gitignore edit away from
# the same thing.
build*/

# CMake leftovers, wherever they land.
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
